:"hu_note","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"9131e8a3-db0e-11ef-bec4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9131e8a7-db0e-11ef-9def-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張晏","people_name_jianti_auto":"张晏","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9131e8a8-db0e-11ef-90c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"9131e8a9-db0e-11ef-bacd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"原父","people_name_jianti_auto":"原父","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"9131e8aa-db0e-11ef-a508-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"惲","people_name_jianti_auto":"恽","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"9131e8ab-db0e-11ef-8f65-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"惲","people_name_jianti_auto":"恽","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"9131e8ac-db0e-11ef-a0a2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：君至尊，父至親。張晏曰：喪不過三年；臣見放逐，降居三月復初。師古曰：旣，已也。原父曰：惲但云送終三年，本不及放逐三月也。余謂惲之此言，實因廢棄而有怨望之意。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：君至尊，父至亲。张晏曰：丧不过三年；臣见放逐，降居三月复初。师古曰：既，已也。原父曰：恽但云送终三年，本不及放逐三月也。余谓恽之此言，实因废弃而有怨望之意。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":191,"tongjian_id":"9131e8a6-db0e-11ef-98e0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"毛晃","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛晃","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"9131e8ae-db0e-11ef-bb70-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"9131e8af-db0e-11ef-89e9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"作苦，謂耕作勞苦也。史記：秦作伏祠，改蜡曰臘。釋名曰：伏者，金氣伏藏之日也。金畏火，故三伏皆庚日。曆忌曰：四時代謝，皆以相生。至於立秋，以金代火。金畏火，故庚日必伏。毛晃曰：夏有三伏，冬有臘，故稱歲時伏臘。","note_content_jianti_auto":"作苦，谓耕作劳苦也。史记：秦作伏祠，改蜡曰腊。释名曰：伏者，金气伏藏之日也。金畏火，故三伏皆庚日。历忌曰：四时代谢，皆以相生。至于立秋，以金代火。金畏火，故庚日必伏。毛晃曰：夏有三伏，冬有腊，故称岁时伏腊。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":211,"tongjian_id":"9131e8ad-db0e-11ef-af0d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9131e8b4-db0e-11ef-8cf7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：炰羔，炙肉也，卽今所謂爊也。余按羊子曰羔，未離乳者也；其肉嫩美。炰，音步交翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：炰羔，炙肉也，即今所谓爊也。余按羊子曰羔，未离乳者也；其肉嫩美。炰，音步交翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":217,"tongjian_id":"9131e8b3-db0e-11ef-b511-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"應劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"应劭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9131e8b7-db0e-11ef-b953-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"9131e8b8-db0e-11ef-abfd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李斯","people_name_jianti_auto":"李斯","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"9131e8b9-db0e-11ef-a570-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"秦王","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦王","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"9131e8ba-db0e-11ef-94ef-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"9131e8bb-db0e-11ef-bdef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"關","place_name_jianti_auto":"关","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"9131e8bc-db0e-11ef-bbfb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"應劭曰：缶，瓦器也；秦人擊之以節歌。師古曰：缶，卽今之盆類也。李斯上秦王書云：「擊甕，叩缶，彈箏，搏髀而歌呼烏烏快耳者，眞秦聲也。」是關中舊有此曲。","note_content_jianti_auto":"应劭曰：缶，瓦器也；秦人击之以节歌。师古曰：缶，即今之盆类也。李斯上秦王书云：「击瓮，叩缶，弹筝，搏髀而歌呼乌乌快耳者，真秦声也。」是关中旧有此曲。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":236,"tongjian_id":"9131e8b6-db0e-11ef-9e88-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張晏","people_name_jianti_auto":"张晏","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"9131e8be-db0e-11ef-8669-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"9131e8bf-db0e-11ef-98fc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"治田曰田，音堂練翻。詩云：無田甫田。張晏曰：山高而在陽，人君之象也。蕪穢不治，言朝廷之荒亂也。一頃，百畝；以喻百官也。言豆貞實之物，當在囷倉，零落在野，喻己見放棄也。萁，曲而不直，言朝臣皆諂諛也。師古曰：萁，豆莖也，音基。治，直之翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"治田曰田，音堂练翻。诗云：无田甫田。张晏曰：山高而在阳，人君之象也。芜秽不治，言朝廷之荒乱也。一顷，百亩；以喻百官也。言豆贞实之物，当在囷仓，零落在野，喻己见放弃也。萁，曲而不直，言朝臣皆谄谀也。师古曰：萁，豆茎也，音基。治，直之翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":261,"tongjian_id":"9131e8bd-db0e-11ef-bf94-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9131e8c3-db0e-11ef-ac9c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：須，待也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：须，待也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":274,"tongjian_id":"9131e8c2-db0e-11ef-8704-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9131e8c5-db0e-11ef-a11a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：自謂爲可也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：自谓为可也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":288,"tongjian_id":"9131e8c4-db0e-11ef-aeec-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"惲","people_name_jiant